:''Not to be confused with [[Rollim]], an NPC that the player can train with if they're in the Mage [[Factions|Faction]].''

'''Mollim''' is an [[NPC]] in {{Zone|Scarleton}} that can be found next to [[Ulyn]]'s shop.

== Quest ==
The player can throw a {{Item|Titanic Experience Bottle}} on '''Mollim''', which will allow them to create the {{Ench|Rainbow II}} [[Enchantment]]. They will then give the player a {{Ench|Rainbow II}} [[Enchanted Book]], and the player will gain {{Purple|20 Mage Reputation}}. 

